{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0443_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2d9f7877d451c0794e208d4c942b8dcd1f7cb051172c88df30bc779177e2ce7b", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影は、エミリーが\n好調だったおかげで、予定よりも早く終わった……）", "zh": "（写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄因为艾米莉状态极佳，比预定时间更早结束了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0443_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "948d3c52f76380ba92b5d820f5b5f059a5a607fc19dd2ac0f95ff26f6b32b70f", "ja": "仕掛け人さま、あの……私の立ち振る舞いは、\n本当に先ほどのもので良かったんでしょうか？", "zh": "制作人大人，那个……我刚才的举止，真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0443_1002_p", "source_sha256": "cddc3e43ce8a215f5ea7bb7bf60ded82b1eda7db09f3c8e0869df8f83a05908c", "ja": "もちろんだ。カメラマンさんも褒めてたけど……\nエミリーは、何か引っかかってるみたいだな。", "zh": "当然了。摄影师也夸过你，不过……艾米莉，你好像还是有些在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0443_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "8bc365a68d485725c131b4e029fbabf20c11c07c52b40f893a9becde4ea96d01", "ja": "……はい。撮影の間、緊張していたので、\nもしや表情や動きに表れていたのではと思いまして。", "zh": "……是的。因为拍摄期间一直很紧张，\n所以我在想，会不会表现在表情和动作上了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0443_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "8c4a93b88731e6fa8f8bc204fa649efa0d8a030e6c7cb493b8392402cd296d9e", "ja": "ですから、今の仕掛け人さまのお言葉を聞けて\n少し安心いたしました。", "zh": "所以，听到刚才制作人先生的话，我稍微安心了一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0443_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e95decfb53428312389f90e1ea0478533c172c05feec46a762d8280713467c0b", "ja": "そうだったのか。でも心配いらないよ。出版社の人達も\n「柔らかい雰囲気で素敵だ」って言ってたしな。", "zh": "原来是这样。不过不用担心。出版社的人也说“这种柔和的氛围很棒”呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0443_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "21ad927197a64d7d3e0111c16ba4c221a1ebe7c8ad5e522d427985926ead8a7e", "ja": "まあっ……！　大人っぽい寝間着の魅力を表現できるか\n不安だったのですが、みなさま、そのように……。", "zh": "哎呀……！原本还很不安，不知道自己\n能否表现出成熟睡衣的魅力，大家居然这么觉得……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0443_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "1515ddde8c917fe5d612a84a3b154e49d3b3a483529a8d04e81d0bd9d6b4f076", "ja": "はっ！　仕掛け人さま……。私、魅惑的な\n衣装の着こなし方を、習得できたかもしれません！", "zh": "啊！制作人先生……我或许已经学会了魅惑服装的穿法！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0443_1008_p", "source_sha256": "bdbbabcb0a70dfd6e2436d993ff49923663fbbefa16cdfa2026a3895fb8cb12d", "ja": "えっ？　魅惑……？", "zh": "咦？魅惑……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0443_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "9303547fd4940cd34886d3d17996cd39bd206ff2a5a5b1b52003c3a36d1c1722", "ja": "はい！　ですが、これはまだ習得への第一歩……！\n完全に身に着けるには、もっと修行が必要です！", "zh": "是的！不过这还只是掌握魅惑之道的第一步……！\n要彻底掌握，还需要更多修行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0443_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "bf9b6ba9544a2b256c8752e92b99e5a45b2718cad3da15c932b17a783f540180", "ja": "自然な身のこなしで、多くのごヒイキ様方を\n魅惑できるように……私、精進いたします！", "zh": "为了能以自然的举止迷倒众多喜爱我的人……我会继续精进！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0443_1011_p", "source_sha256": "cc309dd1d9dfae214d2268908cff3c09565cb98f642c259ba53dd8f86258e02d", "ja": "おお……。\n（エミリーがやる気に満ちている……）", "zh": "哦哦……\n（艾米莉干劲十足……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0443_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "4f323c8e68e369bdcf7a8723799159700c28f43801e80d7999a0aa9b4a200552", "ja": "また一歩、立派な大和撫子へ近づく道が見えました！\n仕掛け人さま、これからもご指導お願いしますね。", "zh": "我又看到了向优秀的大和抚子迈进一步的道路！\n制作人，今后也请继续指导我哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0443_1013_p", "source_sha256": "9891838b4fb6fb81ac1a07d64d7fd91dd9545c23fef276d52f41acfacdfb7c14", "ja": "あ、ああ！　もちろんだ！", "zh": "啊、啊啊！当然可以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0443_1014_032emi", "source_sha256": "5e29630851ca24be31e90ec351f8bbcf9dbe55719d91e065e1f9ddc2dee1a293", "ja": "ありがとうございます♪　それでは、まずどのような\n修行を積むべきか、ご相談させてください！", "zh": "非常感谢您♪那么，首先请让我和您商量一下，\n究竟该积累怎样的修行才好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0443_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c248a087727721ce6536dee9ad9f5321ad25b17e3c24ff35cf0670aa7536f895", "ja": "（張りきる方向がこれでいいのか、少し怪しいが……。\nエミリーの新たな魅力を引き出せたの、かな？）", "zh": "（虽然不太确定她努力的方向是不是对的……\n但我确实发掘出了艾米莉全新的魅力，对吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
